; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5864    \ACCEPT TX tf tf
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5865    \REASON In the configurations it is not possible to test NM_PDURXINDICATIONOFNMBUSNMASSOCIATION with value != STD_ON
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5866            because either the variable ( NM_PDURXINDICATIONOFCHANNELCONFIG == STD_ON ) 
