; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5909  \ID COV_NM_TRANSIENT_START_TIMERS_CASE
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5910    \ACCEPT X
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5911    \REASON The NM_COORDINATOR_START_TIMERS state is only a transient state if there is no 'Synchronizing Network' being
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5912            coordinated. However, the case label is not enclosed by a preprocessor #if / #endif block to minimize risks
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5913            due to changes.
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5914  
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5915  \ID COV_NM_TRANSIENT_WAIT_FOR_TIMERS_CASE
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5916    \ACCEPT X
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5917    \REASON The NM_COORDINATOR_WAIT_FOR_TIMERS state is only a transient state if there is no BusNm on a channel with
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5918            a shutdown delay timer greater than 1. However, the case label is not enclosed by a preprocessor #if / #endif
; ..\BSW\Nm\Nm.c	  5919            block to minimize risks due to changes.
